[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3045\uFF5E\u2026\u2026\uFF01\u3000\u304B\u3001\u98A8\u304C\u51B7\u305F\u3044\u308F\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u6A19\u9AD8\u304C\u9AD8\u3044\u305B\u3044\u304B\u3057\u3089\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh...! The wind... it\u0027s so cold...!\nMust be because of the altitude..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u78BA\u304B\u306B\u3001\u3053\u3053\u306F\u5C11\u3057\u51B7\u3048\u308B\u308F\u306D\u3047",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You\u0027re right, it is a bit chilly up here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u3001\u3068\u3053\u308D\u3067\u3001\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3092\u3053\u3093\u306A\u6240\u306B\n\u9023\u308C\u3066\u304D\u3066\u4F55\u3092\u3059\u308B\u3093\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "By the way, why did you bring me to a place like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u306D\u3047\u3001\u65B0\u5E74\u306E\u666F\u6C17\u4ED8\u3051\u306B\n\u5411\u3053\u3046\u306E\u5C71\u306B\u5411\u304B\u3063\u3066\u62B1\u8CA0\u3092\u53EB\u3076\u3002\u3068\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, maybe to shout our New Year\u0027s resolutions at that mountain over there? Something like that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3001\u3082\u3046\u3002\u3042\u305F\u3057\u305D\u3093\u306A\u6B73\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3067\u3059\u3088\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, come on. I\u0027m not a kid anymore, you know?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u3001\u5197\u8AC7\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, I\u0027m just kidding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3053\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u3067\u306F\u306D\u3001\u661F\u306B\u8FD1\u3044\u3053\u306E\u30D9\u30EB\u30AF\u5C71\u8108\u3092\n\u65B0\u5E74\u306B\u8A2A\u308C\u308B\u306E\u306F\u3059\u3054\u304F\u7E01\u8D77\u306E\u3044\u3044\u3053\u3068\u306A\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In this world, visiting the Berg Mountains during New Year\u0027s is considered very auspicious because they\u0027re closer to the stars."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3063\u304B\u2026\u2026\u3053\u306E\u4E16\u754C\u306E\u6587\u5316\u3060\u3068\u3001\n\u661F\u3092\u4FE1\u4EF0\u3057\u3066\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3063\u305F\u308F\u306D\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, right... In this world, people have faith in the stars..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3046\u3002\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3053\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3092\u3053\u3053\u306B\n\u9023\u308C\u3066\u304D\u305F\u306E\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s right. That\u0027s why I brought you here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u306A\u3093\u3067\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3053\u3068\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3068\u4ECA\u306E\u3042\u305F\u3057\u305F\u3061\u306F\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But why would you...?\nSaskia, you and I right now are..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u305F\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You said it yourself, didn\u0027t you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\u3063\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u79C1\u306E\u611B\u3092\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u308B\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That you believed in my love."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u3093\u306A\u3042\u306A\u305F\u306E\uFF11\u5E74\u304C\u3001\n\u3044\u3044\u3082\u306E\u3067\u3042\u308A\u307E\u3059\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I wanted to make a wish...\nThat you\u0027ll have a wonderful year ahead."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u9858\u3044\u3092\u304B\u3051\u305F\u304F\u306A\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u306E\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I couldn\u0027t help myself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3061\u308D\u3093\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u3060\u3051\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\n\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u305F\u3061\u306B\u3082\u3044\u3044\uFF11\u5E74\u3067\u3042\u3063\u3066\u307B\u3057\u3044\u308F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, not just for you\u2014I wish for Resna and everyone else to have a good year too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307F\u3093\u306A\u3001\u5E78\u305B\u3067\u5065\u5EB7\u3067\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u7B11\u9854\u3067\u3044\u3089\u308C\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306A\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I hope everyone can be happy and healthy...\nAnd keep their smiles..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u3093\u306A\u306B\u771F\u5263\u306B\u7948\u308B\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u304C\n\u3000\u3069\u3046\u3057\u3066\u3042\u305F\u3057\u305F\u3061\u3092\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Saskia\u0027s praying so earnestly...\nWhy would she do this for us...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u2026\u2026\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Saskia...!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u305F\u3061\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3088\u308D\u3057\u304F\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, please take care of Resna and the others, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306E\u3063\u3001\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait, Saskia!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308C\u3063\u2026\u2026\uFF1F\n\u30B6\u3001\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u2026\u2026\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh...?\nS-Saskia...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u884C\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...She\u0027s gone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306F\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306E\u672A\u6765\u3092\n\u3000\u60F3\u3063\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3044\u305F\u2026\u2026\u3002\u3053\u308C\u306F\u672C\u5F53\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Saskia truly cared about everyone\u0027s future...\nThat much is certain.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3053\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306B\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u3082\n\u3000\u8AB0\u3082\u4FE1\u3058\u3066\u304F\u308C\u306A\u3044\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Maybe no one would believe me\nif I told them about this...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306F\u4FE1\u3058\u308B\u2026\u2026\u3002\n\u3000\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306E\u3053\u3068\u3092\u2026\u2026\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even so, I believe...\nI believe in Saskia...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u3002\n\u3042\u305F\u3057\u3001\u3042\u306A\u305F\u304C\u8003\u3048\u3066\u3044\u308B\u3053\u3068\u306F\n\u4F55\u4E00\u3064\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u304B\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia.\nI never understood anything\nabout what you were thinking."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3067\u3082\u3044\u3064\u304B\u7D76\u5BFE\u306B\u660E\u3089\u304B\u306B\u3057\u3066\u307F\u305B\u308B\u304B\u3089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I promise I\u0027ll uncover the truth someday!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u3069\u308C\u304F\u3089\u3044\u304B\u304B\u308B\u304B\u3082\n\u3000\u5206\u304B\u3089\u306A\u3044\u3002\u3082\u3057\u304B\u3057\u305F\u3089\u307F\u3093\u306A\u306B\n\u3000\u5426\u5B9A\u3055\u308C\u308B\u304B\u3082\u3057\u308C\u306A\u3044\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(I don\u0027t know how long it will take.\nMaybe everyone else will doubt me.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u305D\u308C\u3067\u3082\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u3000\u3042\u305F\u3057\u306F\u30B6\u30B9\u30AD\u30A2\u3055\u3093\u306E\u3053\u3068\u8AE6\u3081\u306A\u3044\uFF01\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Even so...!\nI won\u0027t give up on you, Saskia!)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30EA\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]